---
description: Prepare one reviewResults evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: ServiceExperiment[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Reconcile computed administrative metrics with follow-up feedback and implementation evidence. Check changed denominators, observation channels, and minority experiences, then recommend next actions without claiming clinical benefit beyond the study’s scope. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
